{"id": "224500", "name": "שני משתנים גאומטריים בלתי תלויים – חישוב P(X = Y)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X, Y\\)</span> שני משתנים מקריים בלתי תלויים כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathsf{Geo}\\left(\\frac1{{{CT:0}}}\\right)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\sim\\mathsf{Geo}\\left(\\frac1{{{CT:1}}}\\right)\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[X=Y]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מפרקים את המאורע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{X=Y\\}\\)</span> לפי הערך המשותף, משתמשים באי-התלות ומסכמים טור הנדסי.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פירוק לפי הערך המשותף</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=\\frac1{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q=\\frac1{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span>. המאורעות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{X=Y=k\\}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k=1,2,\\dots\\)</span>, זרים, ולפי אי-התלות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[X=Y]=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\mathbb{P}[X=k]\\,\\mathbb{P}[Y=k]=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}p(1-p)^{k-1}\\,q(1-q)^{k-1}=pq\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\big((1-p)(1-q)\\big)^{k-1} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סכום הטור</b><br>זה טור הנדסי עם מנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((1-p)(1-q)=\\frac{ {{CT:2}} }{ {{CT:0}} }\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:4}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[X=Y]=\\frac{pq}{1-(1-p)(1-q)}=\\frac{ {{CT:5}} }{1-{{CT:4}} }={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta", "x", "y"], "nvariants": 50}